  "description": "Introducing the WIRED Freedom - UL2849 certified electric bike with UL2271 certified batteries, the ultimate combination of power, safety, and performance.\n\nThe Freedom features a powerful 3200W motor and dual 60V batteries (2100Wh total capacity) that deliver up to 90 miles of range on a single charge.\n\n3200W Peak Power Motor: Exceptional performance for any terrain\n\nPerfect For\n\nThe Freedom is ideal for riders who demand the best in power, range, and safety. Whether you're commuting long distances, exploring trails, or need a reliable daily rider with exceptional capability, the Freedom delivers uncompromising performance with the peace of mind that comes from UL2849 and UL2271 certifications.\n\nIndustry-Leading Safety\n\nThe WIRED Freedom is UL2849 certified with UL2271 certified batteries. These certifications mean our bike and batteries have been rigorously tested and meet the highest safety standards for electric bikes, giving you confidence and peace of mind with every ride.",
